LNPANDY/NX2Apple
https://github.com/LNPANDY/NX2Apple
Adapted: the key check (Sources/ArcanePorting/Setup/KeyCheck.swift), the
engine failure-message table (PortingFailureReason.swift) and the diagnostics
report idea (DiagnosticsReport.swift) and the self-update rules (AppUpdate.swift).
Also references for dependency detection, HID controller discovery (HIDControllerSource.swift)
and the Home-menu background-pause protocol (HomeMenu.swift; NX2Apple patch 0035).

